# Line endings, settled once.
#
# The site is generated on Windows and, sometimes, elsewhere. Python writes
# CRLF on one and LF on the other, so alternating between them turned every
# regeneration into a 45,000-line diff in which the two lines that actually
# changed were unfindable. Storing text as LF whatever wrote it means a diff
# shows the change and nothing else.
* text=auto eol=lf

# And the pictures are not text. Without this a stray byte pair in a PNG can be
# "corrected" into a corrupt file.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
